  "label": "Critique of religious authority",
  "description": "The meme critiques religious authority by implying that religious institutions impose beliefs on children, which is a common theme in secular and atheist critiques of organized religion. This critique often frames religious authority as coercive or manipulative, and the visual of children carrying crosses is used to symbolize this critique, even though the image may not depict actual religious authority.",
